            {
                "entry_id": "8260830a-f948-3f07-b1b3-7185f84644a2",
                "word": "biceps",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c61855f-737f-3cf4-ab60-22e511949319",
                        "entry_id": "8260830a-f948-3f07-b1b3-7185f84644a2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Muscle dont la partie supérieure est divisée en deux : soit biceps brachial ou biceps fémoral."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fad3c83-d52b-4658-a70f-3c6dcf0db0a7",
                                "sense_id": "0c61855f-737f-3cf4-ab60-22e511949319",
                                "text": "Le biceps du bras ou biceps brachial."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9ec572b-0f12-4d9d-b287-6a9649d17676",
                                "sense_id": "0c61855f-737f-3cf4-ab60-22e511949319",
                                "text": "Le biceps de la cuisse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7144e20-aa58-4a1e-9228-be54eb05157d",
                                "sense_id": "0c61855f-737f-3cf4-ab60-22e511949319",
                                "text": "Du point de vue diagnostique et thérapeutique, il faut individualiser les ruptures des tendons de la coiffe des rotateurs, des tendons du biceps et du triceps, et des tendons des poignets et des doigts."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8518daa3-c87f-3e9b-964e-924b6067e1de",
                        "entry_id": "8260830a-f948-3f07-b1b3-7185f84644a2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Biceps brachial, muscle du bras."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9a58f39-ca8e-4f93-ad37-93a49e1dad3a",
                                "sense_id": "8518daa3-c87f-3e9b-964e-924b6067e1de",
                                "text": "Nous disons que la femme n’est pas destinée exclusivement à faire et à élever des enfants, pas plus que l’homme n’est exclusivement créé pour s’enorgueillir de ses biceps et pour travailler de ses bras."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd491b7f-e1b8-4ca7-88d2-43d4a9449b99",
                                "sense_id": "8518daa3-c87f-3e9b-964e-924b6067e1de",
                                "text": "Les mouvements de flexion et d’extension de l’avant-bras sont gérés par plusieurs muscles dont le biceps (muscle fléchisseur) et le triceps (muscle extenseur)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8be543ed-ab92-4693-a694-77da4fb15542",
                                "sense_id": "8518daa3-c87f-3e9b-964e-924b6067e1de",
                                "text": "Avoir du biceps, avoir ce muscle très développé, être très vigoureux."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4d1b6c5-be84-44cf-b2f8-2d222eff3b28",
                        "source_entry_id": "8260830a-f948-3f07-b1b3-7185f84644a2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Biceps brachial ou fémoral",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bizeps",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bizeps",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1aa5667-3f93-3ae9-b7fc-65d9a3bf9c26",
                                        "entry_id": "edea1a0e-85d7-3deb-a08c-6d34f278c4e4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zweiköpfiger Muskel des Oberarms, dessen Hauptfunktionen die Beugung des Ellenbogengelenks, die Supination des Unterarms und unterstützende Bewegungen im Schultergelenk (Anteversion, Abduktion, Adduktion) sind"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75d73e60-870a-41fb-a74d-e1007e93d026",
                                                "sense_id": "c1aa5667-3f93-3ae9-b7fc-65d9a3bf9c26",
                                                "text": "Der Bizeps ist der Gegenspieler des Trizepses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb2d5d0c-0d41-4977-990d-2b3ceebbe973",
                                                "sense_id": "c1aa5667-3f93-3ae9-b7fc-65d9a3bf9c26",
                                                "text": "Die Hauptfunktion des Bizepses (auch: des Bizeps) besteht darin, das Beugen des Armes im Ellbogengelenk zu ermöglichen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bae17132-9816-42a4-b8f8-2c3200d7cb92",
                                                "sense_id": "c1aa5667-3f93-3ae9-b7fc-65d9a3bf9c26",
                                                "text": "Trainiert man seinen Bizeps, so steigert man auch die Schlagkraft des Armes."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a5547f8-0bd3-3157-96bd-0d50b075ef5f",
                                        "entry_id": "edea1a0e-85d7-3deb-a08c-6d34f278c4e4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zweiköpfiger Muskel der Oberschenkelrückseite, der für die Kniebeugung, Hüftstreckung und Außenrotation des Knies verantwortlich ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cc53cda8-a4eb-4fc0-a2df-ad6bc189ef28",
                        "source_entry_id": "8260830a-f948-3f07-b1b3-7185f84644a2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Biceps brachial ou fémoral",
                        "target_lang_word": "biceps",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "biceps",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55ac072b-2aa8-3d4b-91c4-e43add7cd9b4",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any muscle having two heads."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b1af2e1-2d97-424c-a7ab-29adb401b079",
                                                "sense_id": "55ac072b-2aa8-3d4b-91c4-e43add7cd9b4",
                                                "text": "The leg is bent by the action of the flexor muscles situated on the back of the thigh, the chief of these being called the biceps of the leg."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cd44ad0-de05-32c1-9495-d8f77978b8c6",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Specifically, the biceps brachii, the flexor of the elbow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35839e0d-9037-4865-85d6-deadb7dc2151",
                                                "sense_id": "5cd44ad0-de05-32c1-9495-d8f77978b8c6",
                                                "text": "The arm muscles are the show muscles of the physique. When someone asks to \"see your muscles,\" they are most likely referring to your arms, and more specifically, your biceps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The upper arm, especially the collective muscles of the upper arm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d2a9aef-c2e0-4a2c-a79b-d55610e778e2",
                                                "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                                "text": "Today, Stonewall's flexed biceps measure 18 inches around."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19272f1b-20d2-46c3-9fda-60c7b3f970d3",
                                                "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                                "text": "Biting her lip, she held his biceps for balance and waded farther."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96ce126f-de07-4e23-bd8b-9340def2c2b5",
                                                "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                                "text": "Odin examined the arm-ring, then pushed it onto his arm, up high on his biceps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf58af40-4182-371f-bfa6-a8ce68c91d35",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A point in a metrical pattern that can be filled either with one long syllable (a longum) or two short syllables (two brevia)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7520640-87d8-486a-a5f9-f38d02481aea",
                                                "sense_id": "cf58af40-4182-371f-bfa6-a8ce68c91d35",
                                                "text": "Also it is advisable to distinguish this ( ˘ ˘ ) — ˘ ˘ — rhythm, where the princeps was probably shorter in duration than the biceps (as in the dactylic hexameter), from true (marching) anapaests, in which they were equal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "618a4b4a-00ea-4f95-ba3a-1ad30ca798dd",
                                                "sense_id": "cf58af40-4182-371f-bfa6-a8ce68c91d35",
                                                "text": "This means that in the metrical sequence[…] recited in ordinary speech rhythm, the princeps occupied a slightly shorter time than the biceps (5:6), and if a long syllable was used to fill the biceps it had to be dragged a little[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
